    {
        "id": "ns_tab",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "NetSpeaker",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Beispiel: NetSpeaker per MQTT steuern. Broker und Basis-Topic anpassen (Standard netspeaker/<Hostname>).\nExample: control the NetSpeaker via MQTT. Adjust broker and base topic (default netspeaker/<hostname>)."
